    "created_at": "2016-07-13T15:18:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-13T15:18:45Z",
    "body": "What I'm saying is that maybe the spec doesn't need to mention `object-fit` at all? I can't quite figure out the original meaning of 2b8bb8d5cb2e2406d194cd74f4f3e44a077ab142, so it's hard to say. @annevk?\n",
