    "created_at": "2016-07-13T21:48:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-13T21:48:53Z",
    "body": "I do think `object-fit: contain` itself makes sense, because when we put something in fullscreen, people in general should expect the aspect ratio of the content is not changed.\n",
